[38;5;252m[1m## What the configuration space actually is[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mtranslation/Cargo.toml[0m has no [38;5;10m[features][0m table and [38;5;10mc_src/CMakeLists.txt[0m has no options or [38;5;10m-D[0m defines, so there is exactly one valid configuration: the default. [38;5;10mverify.sh[0m still derives the combination list from [38;5;10mCargo.toml[0m programmatically (powerset of declared features) so it stays correct if features are added later, and it runs the whole matrix in both dev and release profiles.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## The bug I found and fixed[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The C is compiled at [38;5;10m-O0[0m (CMake's build type is empty), and its [38;5;10mfloat[0m math is plain scalar SSE. Those instructions propagate NaNs asymmetrically: the result is the [3mfirst[23m (destination) operand when it is a NaN, otherwise the second, with the mantissa's high bit forced on and the sign bit and remaining payload carried through untouched.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The original Rust used plain [38;5;10m+[0m/[38;5;10m-[0m/[38;5;10m*[0m, and LLVM legitimately rewrote them in ways that are value-preserving but not payload-preserving:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- [38;5;10ml - 0.5f32 * c[0m became [38;5;10m(-0.5 * c) + l[0m (the negation folded into the literal), so [38;5;10mm[0m picked up [38;5;10mc[0m's NaN instead of [38;5;10ml[0m's.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10m(1.0 - abs(...)) * s[0m was commuted to put [38;5;10ms[0m in the destination register, so [38;5;10mc[0m picked up [38;5;10ms[0m's NaN instead.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Concretely, for [38;5;10msrc = [0.0, 1e-45, -NaN][0m the C wrote [38;5;10mdest[2] = 0xffc00000[0m and the Rust wrote [38;5;10m0x7fc00000[0m — the sign bit was lost.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The fix routes the arithmetic through [38;5;10mfadd[0m/[38;5;10mfsub[0m/[38;5;10mfmul[0m/[38;5;10mfdiv[0m/[38;5;10mfabs[0m helpers in [38;5;10msrc/lib.rs[0m that spell out the NaN selection explicitly and only fall back on the hardware for NaN-free operands. That makes the result independent of how LLVM schedules the code, and it documents at each call site where the reference build's operand order differs from the C source text (gcc emits both multiplications with the parenthesised factor first). [38;5;10mfabs[0m is a bitwise sign clear, matching the [38;5;10mandps[0m the C uses, which notably does [3mnot[23m quiet a signalling NaN.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Test harness[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mtranslation/tests/[0m loads both [38;5;10m.so[0ms through [38;5;10mlibloading[0m — the Rust side is never called directly, so the [38;5;10m#[no_mangle][0m wrapper is under test. [38;5;10mdest[0m is a guarded 8-float buffer whose canary slots catch overwrites, and comparisons are on raw bit patterns so [38;5;10m-0.0[0m vs [38;5;10m0.0[0m and differing NaN payloads both fail. Coverage: the [38;5;10ms == 0[0m shortcut, every 60-degree sector boundary walked ±3000 ULPs, [38;5;10mfmodf[0m wrap points, a 52³ cross product of special values, aliased [38;5;10mdest == src[0m buffers, and ~3M fuzz cases spanning plausible ranges, the full [38;5;10mf32[0m bit space, and live-hue-with-wild-[38;5;10ms[0m/[38;5;10ml[0m (needed because a NaN hue falls straight into the final [38;5;10melse[0m and would hide the [38;5;10mc[0m/[38;5;10mm[0m/[38;5;10mx[0m paths). [38;5;10mtests/symbols.rs[0m asserts via [38;5;10mnm -D[0m that every symbol the C [38;5;10m.so[0m exports is exported by the Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m — parity holds exactly, even unfiltered.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## One trap worth knowing[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mcargo test[0m does [1mnot[22m rebuild a [38;5;10mcdylib[0m-only lib target, so the tests initially loaded a stale [38;5;10m.so[0m and my first "fix" appeared to do nothing. The harness now pins the profile directory via [38;5;10mcfg!(debug_assertions)[0m and fails loudly if the [38;5;10m.so[0m is older than [38;5;10msrc/lib.rs[0m; [38;5;10mverify.sh[0m runs an explicit [38;5;10mcargo build[0m before each [38;5;10mcargo test[0m.[0m[0m
